Hi! I'm Nita. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:14.102
Unit fourteen: Money Matters. In this unit, you will talk about finances, regrets and wishes.

4
00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:15.955
mortgage.

5
